# os / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# book scans: never commit photographs of the source book, and never commit a
# transcription of its prose. Only our own extraction notes are tracked.
docs/sources/*
!docs/sources/README.md
!docs/sources/*.md
# our own notes: allowed (they record pages + concepts in our words, never prose)
!docs/sources/notes/
!docs/sources/notes/**
# verbatim OCR output: blocked, because it is a transcription of the book
docs/sources/raw-text/
docs/sources/raw/
